hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15742","Mu'awiyah ibn Hisham narrated to us, Sufyan narrated to us, from Abd Allah ibn Uthman, my father said: And Qabisah narrated to us, from Sufyan, from Ibn Khuthaym, from Abd al-Rahman ibn Bahman, from Abd al-Rahman ibn Hassan, from his father, he said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) cursed women who visit graves."
